 ## Background
-Application-specific NeRF methods emerged to address limitations of the standard framework in complex real-world scenarios involving dynamic lighting, sparse views, specific physical modalities (like SAR), or extreme geometric constraints (like mirrors or portraits). Key developments include:
-*   **Dynamic and Illumination Handling:** Methods like RehearsalNeRF [12477-rehearsalnerf.md] addressed the entanglement of geometry and illumination, a common issue in real-world captures.
-*   **Sparse View and Single-Image Synthesis:** Portrait-NeRF [13429-portrait-nerf.md] and 360FusionNeRF [12755-360fusionnerf.md] explored meta-learning and semantic priors to overcome the ill-posed nature of single-view reconstruction.
-*   **Physical Priors and External Data:** Urban Radiance Fields [11973-urban-radiance-fields.md] integrated LiDAR data to handle unbounded outdoor scenes, while Neural SAR [12668-neural-sar-surface-reconstruction-via-inverse-rendering.md] adapted the rendering equation for radar physics.
-*   **High-Frequency Detail and Super-Resolution:** CROP [10371-cross-guided-optimization-of-radiance-fields-crop.md] introduced iterative super-resolution to overcome the spectral bias of MLPs.
-*   **Complex Reflections:** Mirror-NeRF [13482-mirror-nerf.md] unified reflection modeling within the radiance field framework.
-*   **View Extrapolation:** RapNeRF [S1] targeted the specific challenge of extrapolating beyond the training camera poses.
+Application-specific NeRF methods emerged to address limitations of the standard framework in complex real-world scenarios involving dynamic lighting, sparse views, specific physical modalities (like SAR), or extreme geometric constraints (like mirrors or portraits) [G]. Key developments include:
+* **Dynamic and Illumination Handling:** Methods like [RehearsalNeRF](12477-rehearsalnerf.md) addressed the entanglement of geometry and illumination, a common issue in real-world captures.
+* **Sparse View and Single-Image Synthesis:** [Portrait-NeRF](13429-portrait-nerf.md) and [360FusionNeRF](12755-360fusionnerf.md) explored meta-learning and semantic priors to overcome the ill-posed nature of single-view reconstruction.
+* **Physical Priors and External Data:** [Urban Radiance Fields](11973-urban-radiance-fields.md) integrated LiDAR data to handle unbounded outdoor scenes, while [Neural SAR Surface Reconstruction via Inverse Rendering](12668-neural-sar-surface-reconstruction-via-inverse-rendering.md) adapted the rendering equation for radar physics.
+* **High-Frequency Detail and Super-Resolution:** [Cross-Guided Optimization of Radiance Fields (CROP)](10371-cross-guided-optimization-of-radiance-fields-crop.md) introduced iterative super-resolution to overcome the spectral bias of MLPs.
+* **Complex Reflections:** [Mirror-NeRF](13482-mirror-nerf.md) unified reflection modeling within the radiance field framework.
+* **View Extrapolation:** RapNeRF [S1] targeted the specific challenge of extrapolating beyond the training camera poses.
 
